Non-Functional Requirements
NFR-01 (Performance):
The system shall respond to user requests within 2 seconds.
NFR-02 (Security):
All user passwords shall be encrypted.
NFR-03 (Availability):
The system shall be available 99% of the time.
NFR-04 (Usability):
The system shall be easy to use with minimal training.
NFR-05 (Scalability):
The system shall support an increasing number of users.
